Article 115 of isu.talk.misc:
~Newsgroups: isu.talk.misc
Path: news.iastate.edu!pv0220.vincent.iastate.edu!shenoy
~From: shenoy@iastate.edu (Shivanand Shenoy)
~Subject: Re: Newsgroups
